You got this.

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:17.230
Don't spill.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:17.380
You got this.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:17.630
Don't spill.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:18.340
You got this.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:18.430
Don't spill.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:18.580
You got this.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.051
Don't spill.

00:03:19.051 --> 00:03:19.522
You got this.

00:03:19.522 --> 00:03:20.464
Don't spill, don't spill.

00:03:20.464 --> 00:03:20.935
You got this, you got this.

00:03:20.935 --> 00:03:21.406
Don't spill, don't spill.

00:03:21.406 --> 00:03:21.877
You got this, you got this.

00:03:21.877 --> 00:03:22.348
Don't spill, don't spill.

00:03:22.348 --> 00:03:22.819
You got it, you got it.

00:03:22.819 --> 00:03:23.290
Don't spill, don't spill.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.415
Got it, got it, you got it.

00:03:24.415 --> 00:03:28.550
All right, and last, we wait for the freeze pops to freeze.

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:29.050
Hm.

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:30.842
What do we do while we wait? (WHISPERING) I

00:03:30.842 --> 00:03:32.100
have a hard time waiting.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.645
Hm, well, what if we make camel noises?

00:03:35.645 --> 00:03:37.195
Well, what does a camel sound like?

00:03:37.195 --> 00:03:40.210
Like this [CAMEL NOISE].

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:42.180
[CAMEL NOISE]

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.650
[CAMEL NOISE]

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.068
[CAMEL NOISE]

00:03:45.068 --> 00:03:45.610
[CAMEL NOISE]

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:46.590
[CAMEL NOISE]

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:47.570
[CAMEL NOISE]

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:50.290
Hm, well, we've been doing that a while.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.710
Let's take the freeze pops, huh?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.910
OK.

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:55.280
They're done.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:57.040
Wow, make freeze pops, check.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:57.540
[DING]

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:00.450
Cody, Scatter, I did my job.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.060
Follow me.

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:04.100
I found a way to keep the freeze pops cold.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:04.600
Yeah?

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.150
We can put them in here.

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:06.900
