00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.010
Oh--

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.790
Hello, penguin.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.410
It is very cold.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:13.230
Oh, Heart, I am so sorry.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.240
My instructions were not clear enough.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.339
They were not?

00:04:16.339 --> 00:04:17.640
Mm-mm, no.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.610
Heart, we need to keep the freeze pops cold when we take

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.650
