00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.780
Yeah?

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.150
Oh, fantastic.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:30.400
But it is full of snow.

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.400
This is so great, Heart.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.060
We can use the snow to keep the freeze pops cold.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:35.970
Oh, yeah.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:38.220
Find a way to keep the freeze pops cold, check.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:38.980
[DING]

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.370
All the jobs are done.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.148
Mm.

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:43.004
[DING]

00:04:43.004 --> 00:04:46.980
Oh, it's so hot.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:51.780
Don't worry, Felix will be here with freeze pops soon.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.550
I'm telling you, no, he won't.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.560
He's going to his brother's reunion.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.229
Frozen freeze pops!

00:04:57.229 --> 00:04:57.729
Huh?

00:04:57.729 --> 00:04:58.858
Frozen freeze pops!

00:04:58.858 --> 00:05:00.150
That sounds like the Helpsters!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:00.780
Come on, let's go.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:01.215
Let's go.

00:05:01.215 --> 00:05:01.770
Oh.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:04.985
Get your frozen freeze pops here.

00:05:04.985 --> 00:05:05.485
Freeze pops!

00:05:05.485 --> 00:05:06.100
Freeze pops?

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:06.832
Freeze pops?

00:05:06.832 --> 00:05:07.790
Here you go, try these.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.380
Oh, yeah.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:08.530
Yes, yes, yes.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:08.910
