00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:13.110
Hope you like those.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.415
Much cooler.

00:05:14.415 --> 00:05:16.027
Mm, much cooler.

00:05:16.027 --> 00:05:17.360
Thanks for your help, Helpsters.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:19.420
You're very welcome.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.360
We did it, everybody.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:23.500
(IN UNISON) Yeah, we did.

